#created by Duel Circuit - Light and Darkness Ritual / Dark Magician Chaos (2026)
#era 2026
#tier Pre-list elite / Houston champion
#about Black Chaos, Light and Darkness Ritual and Dark Magician-linked cards form a recursive Ritual-focused engine with multiple directions for follow-up and disruption. Hybrid variants can incorporate Albaz/Branded and Azamina tools.
#why Trevor Parker won YCS Houston with the strategy. Magicians’ Souls was subsequently forbidden; the winning configuration cannot simply be copied into the new format.
